## Why This Is Asked

Real-time data with strict latency and privacy requirements benefits from process isolation, IPC surfaces, and robust crypto handling. This tests tradeoffs between latency, security, and resilience.

## Key Concepts

- Isolated Android process and AIDL IPC surface
- Real-time streaming with backpressure and windowed updates
- Protobuf payloads, signature verification, Android Keystore cryptography
- Per-symbol subscription management and offline recovery
- Testing: latency budgets, event ordering, failure/recovery scenarios

